# Everything here ends up inside a Linux image or is run by sh/bash, so keep LF even in
# a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true (the Dockerfile strips CRs too, as a
# backstop for the gitignored personal files). PowerShell scripts are fine either way;
# CRLF is just the Windows convention for them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.ps1.example text eol=crlf
